---
pagination: { data: languages, size: 1, alias: lang }
permalink: "{{ '/' if lang == 'en' else '/es/' }}meetings/index.html"
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageKey: meetings
titleKey: nav.meetings
descKey: committee.meetings.meta_desc
pageScripts: ["/assets/js/committee.js"]
---
{#- Meetings (/meetings/ — the old /meeting/ address redirects here, #anchors kept: meeting.njk).
    The shared page hero (two jump links: the Grapevine meetings and the weekly open meetings), the
    committee sub-nav, then:
    (a) #committee-meeting — the committee's monthly Zoom meeting: live countdown, how to join, the
        next dates (+ the calendar feed), who can attend, the chair and what happens at the meeting,
        on one board that ends level on wide screens;
    (b) #grapevine-meetings — the Grapevine ("GR") meetings of the meeting lists in and next to our
        Area (db.meetings, its ONE home on the site): one card per group with its whole week, our
        Area first, by office region (Dallas area, Fort Worth area …), then each nearby region —
        both halves with the same region heads; filters (day, city/county/group, in person/online,
        nearby on/off) in committee.js (cmGvMeetings) — without JavaScript every group shows;
    (c) #weekly-open — the weekly open meetings of AA Grapevine and La Viña.
    Each section opens with ui.sectionHead (eyebrow, title, one line of text). -#}
{% import "macros/ui.njk" as ui with context %}
{%- set m = site.meeting -%}
{%- set gvm = db.meetings | cmGvMeetings(lang, site) -%}
{%- set next = site | cmNextMeeting(lang) -%}
{%- set rule = m | cmRule(lang) -%}
{%- set timeRange = m | cmTimeRange(lang) -%}
{#- The weekly open meetings (Grapevine Weekly Open + La Viña), the page language's first -#}
{%- set wos = db.weekly_open.items | cmWeeklyAll(lang) -%}
{#- Monthly recurring events (config/site.yml `recurring_events:`, e.g. the CityWide Dallas booth):
    their next date, as a small "Also every month" box under the meeting dates -#}
{%- set monthly = db.events.items | cmRecurringNext(site, lang) -%}
{%- set pageAbs = page.url | siteUrl(site) -%}
{%- set cfg = {
  rule: m | cmRuleObj,
  start: next.startIso if next else "",
  end: next.endIso if next else "",
  title: next.title if next else "",
  description: next.calDescription if next else "",
  location: next.calLocation if next else "",
  url: pageAbs,
  i18n: {
    join: "committee.meeting.join" | t(lang),
    soon: "committee.meeting.join_soon" | t(lang),
    live: "committee.meeting.join_live" | t(lang),
    yourTime: "committee.meeting.your_time" | t(lang)
  }
} -%}

{#- ============ Hero: title, what is on the page, and the two other sections of the page ============
    The committee meeting is the first block right under the hero (its Join button and live
    countdown are there), so it needs no jump link. -#}
{% call ui.pageHero(lang, "nav.meetings" | t(lang), "committee.meetings.hero_sub" | t(lang), "calendar-clock", "committee.meetings.eyebrow" | t(lang)) %}
  <nav class="hero-actions" aria-label="{{ 'committee.meetings.jump_aria' | t(lang) }}">
    <a href="#grapevine-meetings" class="btn-light">{% icon "grapes", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.meetings.find_gv" | t(lang) }}</a>
    <a href="#weekly-open" class="btn-on-dark">{% icon "video", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.meetings.jump_weekly" | t(lang) }}</a>
  </nav>
{% endcall %}

{% committeeNav lang, "meetings", db %}

{#- ================= (a) The committee's monthly meeting ================= -#}
<section class="container-page section pt-10 sm:pt-12" aria-labelledby="committee-meeting-h">
  <div id="committee-meeting">
  {{ ui.sectionHead("committee.meetings.committee_title" | t(lang),
    ("committee.meeting.hero_sub" | t(lang, { rule: rule, time: timeRange })) if next else ("committee.meeting.no_next" | t(lang)),
    "", "", "users", { eyebrow: "committee.meetings.committee_eyebrow" | t(lang), id: "committee-meeting-h", lang: lang }) }}
  </div>

  {#- ============ The meeting board (one grid, so every card lines up) ============
      Markup order = phone order: next meeting → how to join → the next dates → who can come → the
      chair (questions) → what happens. Tablets: who | chair side by side. From 1024px two columns
      (committee.css .cm-board):  countdown | how to join  ·  who | chair  ·  what happens (both
      columns)  ·  the dates (both columns, laid out in rows of three). From 1280px three columns: the
      countdown and the dates on the left; how to join, who | chair and what happens on the right —
      both sides end together. The cards lay out their own insides by their width (container queries). -#}
  <div class="cm-board">

    {#- ---------- Live countdown ---------- -#}
    {% if next %}
    <article id="next-meeting" class="cm-count" x-data="cmMeeting({{ cfg | json }})" aria-labelledby="next-meeting-h">
      <span class="cm-count-art" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "calendar-clock", "size-full" %}</span>
      <h3 id="next-meeting-h" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/80">
        <span class="cm-live-dot" x-show="phase !== 'upcoming'" x-cloak></span>
        <span x-show="phase === 'upcoming'">{{ "committee.meeting.next" | t(lang) }}</span>
        <span x-show="phase === 'soon'" x-cloak>{{ "committee.meeting.starting_soon" | t(lang) }}</span>
        <span x-show="phase === 'live'" x-cloak>{{ "committee.meeting.live_now" | t(lang) }}</span>
      </h3>
      <p class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-balance text-white sm:text-3xl min-[80rem]:max-[112.5rem]:text-2xl" x-text="dateLabel">{{ next.dateLabel }}</p>
      <p class="mt-1.5 text-white/85">
        <span x-text="timeLabel">{{ next.timeLabel }}</span>
        <span class="block text-sm text-white/70" x-show="localLabel" x-text="localLabel" x-cloak></span>
      </p>

      {#- The tiles sit right under the date; the buttons end the card -#}
      <div role="timer" aria-live="off" class="cm-tiles my-5" x-cloak x-show="phase !== 'live'">
        {% for u in [["d", "common.days"], ["h", "common.hours"], ["m", "common.min"], ["s", "common.sec"]] %}
        <div class="cm-tile">
          <span class="cm-tile-num" x-text="{{ 'd' if u[0] == 'd' else 'pad(' + u[0] + ')' }}">–</span>
          <span class="cm-tile-label">{{ u[1] | t(lang) }}</span>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      {#- Join on its own row, then Add to calendar + Share (an icon) while the card is narrow; one
          row when the card is wide (committee.css .cm-count-actions) -#}
      <div class="mt-auto pt-1">
        <div class="cm-count-actions">
          <a href="{{ m.zoom_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-light" :class="phase !== 'upcoming' && 'cm-join-live'">
            <span class="cm-live-dot" x-show="phase !== 'upcoming'" x-cloak></span>
            {% icon "video", "size-4" %}
            <span x-text="joinText">{{ "committee.meeting.join" | t(lang) }}</span>
          </a>
          <details class="cm-menu">
            <summary class="btn-on-dark">{% icon "calendar-plus", "size-4" %} {{ "common.add_to_calendar" | t(lang) }} {% icon "chevron-down", "size-4 opacity-70" %}</summary>
            <div class="cm-menu-panel">
              <a :href="gcal" href="{{ next.gcal }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "calendar", "size-4" %} Google Calendar</a>
              <a :href="outlook" href="{{ next.outlook }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "calendar", "size-4" %} Outlook.com</a>
              <button type="button" @click="downloadIcs()" data-cm-js>{% icon "download", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.cal.ics_file" | t(lang) }}</button>
            </div>
          </details>
          <button type="button" class="btn-on-dark cm-count-share" data-share="{{ pageAbs }}" data-share-title="{{ 'nav.meeting' | t(lang) }} — NETA 65" data-share-text="{{ rule }} · {{ timeRange }}">{% icon "share-2", "size-4" %} <span class="cm-count-share-label">{{ "common.share" | t(lang) }}</span></button>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/75" x-show="phase === 'upcoming'">{{ "committee.meeting.join_hint" | t(lang) }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% else %}
    <div id="next-meeting" class="cm-count justify-center">
      <p class="text-lg text-white/90">{{ "committee.meeting.no_next" | t(lang) }}</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {#- ---------- How to join (Zoom ID + passcode). Join is the countdown's button; here: copy the link,
        the ID and the passcode ---------- -#}
    <div class="cm-join card card-pad @container flex flex-col">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span>{% icon "video", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "committee.meeting.how_to_join" | t(lang) }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-[60ch] text-muted">{{ "committee.meeting.how_to_join_text" | t(lang) }}</p>

      <dl class="mt-5 grid gap-3 @min-[38rem]:grid-cols-2">
        {% if m.meeting_id %}
        <div class="cm-field">
          <dt class="eyebrow">{{ "committee.meeting.id" | t(lang) }}</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink @sm:text-2xl">{{ m.meeting_id }}</span>
            <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm" data-copy="{{ m.meeting_id | cmDigits }}" aria-label="{{ 'committee.meeting.copy_id' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "copy", "size-4" %} {{ "common.copy" | t(lang) }}</button>
          </dd>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if m.passcode %}
        <div class="cm-field">
          <dt class="eyebrow">{{ "committee.meeting.passcode" | t(lang) }}</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-xl font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink @sm:text-2xl">{{ m.passcode }}</span>
            <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm" data-copy="{{ m.passcode }}" aria-label="{{ 'committee.meeting.copy_passcode' | t(lang) }}">{% icon "copy", "size-4" %} {{ "common.copy" | t(lang) }}</button>
          </dd>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </dl>

      <div class="mt-4">
        <button type="button" class="btn-secondary" data-copy="{{ m.zoom_url }}">{% icon "link", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.meeting.copy_link" | t(lang) }}</button>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 border-t border-line pt-5 text-sm text-muted @3xl:grid-cols-3">
        <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-gv">{% icon "clock-3", "size-4" %}</span><span>{{ "committee.meeting.tip_early" | t(lang) }}</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-gv">{% icon "smartphone", "size-4" %}</span><span>{{ "committee.meeting.tip_phone" | t(lang) }}</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-gv">{% icon "languages", "size-4" %}</span><span>{{ "committee.meeting.tip_lang" | t(lang) }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    {#- ---------- The next dates · also every month · the calendar feed (from 1024 to 1279px the card
        spans the board, and its dates sit in rows of three: committee.css .cm-dates) ---------- -#}
    <div class="cm-dates-card card card-pad flex flex-col">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span>{% icon "calendar-days", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "committee.meeting.next_dates" | t(lang) }}</h3>
      {% set dates = meeting.upcoming | limit(7) %}
      {% if dates | length %}
      <ol class="cm-dates mt-5" data-cm-max="6">
        {% for d in dates %}
        <li class="cm-date-row{{ ' is-next' if loop.first }}{{ ' hidden' if loop.index > 6 }}" data-cm-expire="{{ d.end }}">
          <span class="cm-mini-tile" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>{{ d.start | fmtDate(lang, "monthShort") | replace(".", "") }}</span>
            <strong>{{ d.start | fmtDate(lang, "day") }}</strong>
          </span>
          <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <span class="block font-semibold text-ink">{{ d.start | fmtDate(lang, "long") }}</span>
            <span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ d.start | fmtDate(lang, "time") }}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="cm-next-badge badge-vine">{{ "committee.meeting.next_badge" | t(lang) }}</span>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
      {% else %}
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted">{{ "committee.meeting.no_next" | t(lang) }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if monthly | length %}
      <div class="mt-6 border-t border-line pt-4">
        <h4 class="eyebrow font-sans">{{ "committee.meeting.also_monthly" | t(lang) }}</h4>
        <ul class="mt-2.5 space-y-3">
          {% for ev in monthly %}
          {#- the whole line is the link's target (after:inset-0), not just its title -#}
          <li class="relative flex gap-2.5 rounded-lg">
            <span class="mt-0.5 text-vine">{% icon "repeat", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0">
              <a class="font-semibold text-ink underline-offset-2 after:absolute after:inset-0 after:content-[''] hover:text-gv hover:underline" href="{{ '/events/' | lurl(lang) }}#{{ ev.anchor }}">{{ ev.title }}</a>
              <span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ ev.recurrence }}</span>
              {#- Spanish weekday and month names are lower-case inside a sentence -#}
              <span class="block text-sm text-muted">{{ "committee.meeting.also_next" | t(lang, { date: (ev.dateLabel | lower) if lang == "es" else ev.dateLabel }) }}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {#- The calendar feed (every meeting and event) is set up in ONE place: /events/#subscribe -#}
      <p class="mt-auto pt-3"><a href="{{ '/events/' | lurl(lang) }}#subscribe" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-gv hover:underline">{% icon "calendar-sync", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.meeting.subscribe_all" | t(lang) }}</a></p>
    </div>

    {#- ---------- Who can come ---------- -#}
    <div class="cm-who card card-pad">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span class="text-vine!">{% icon "hand-heart", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "committee.meeting.who_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-[65ch] leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "committee.meeting.who_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {% for k in ["gvr", "rlv", "dcm", "members"] %}<li class="badge-muted text-xs">{{ ("committee.meeting.who_" + k) | t(lang) }}</li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>

    {#- ---------- The chair (questions) ---------- -#}
    <div class="cm-chair card card-pad flex flex-col">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span>{% icon "mail", "size-5" %}</span>{{ m | pick(lang, "chair_title") }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-[65ch] leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "committee.meeting.contact_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 pt-5">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="{{ (m.chair_email or site.contact_email) | mailto('committee.meeting.mail_subject' | t(lang)) }}">{% icon "mail", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.meeting.write_chair" | t(lang) }}</a>
        <button type="button" class="btn-secondary max-w-full" data-copy="{{ m.chair_email or site.contact_email }}">{% icon "copy", "size-4" %} <span class="truncate">{{ m.chair_email or site.contact_email }}</span></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    {#- ---------- What happens at the meeting: six numbered steps (1 → 2 → 3 columns by the card's width) ---------- -#}
    <div class="cm-agenda card card-pad @container flex flex-col">
      <h3 class="card-h"><span>{% icon "list-ordered", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "committee.meeting.agenda_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-1.5 text-muted">{{ "committee.meeting.agenda_sub" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <ol class="cm-steps mt-5">
        {% for s in ["welcome", "reports", "news", "plan", "questions", "close"] %}
        <li class="cm-step">
          <span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <h4 class="font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">{{ ("committee.meeting.step_" + s) | t(lang) }}</h4>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ ("committee.meeting.step_" + s + "_text") | t(lang) }}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ================= (b) Grapevine meetings in our Area and nearby =================
    One card per GROUP and place (db.meetings, via cmGvMeetings → places): where (city · county),
    the group's name, its types (Grapevine first; what only some of its meetings have is said next
    to their time), its week as rows of weekdays with the same times ("Wed–Fri · 6:30 AM"), the
    address, in person / online, then Directions | Details (the meeting's page on the office's own
    site: the joining details and any changes live there — nothing else is copied).
    Both halves are organised the same way, by region: our Area by the office that lists the group
    (Dallas area, Fort Worth area, East Texas, Abilene — config/site.yml meetings.feeds region_label),
    then each nearby region. Every region opens with the same head (icon · name · "N groups ·
    M meetings"); small regions share a row, and no row is left with an empty column (the card
    spans come from packRegions in eleventy/filters/committee.js: --r2/--r3/--r4 on a region and
    --c2/--c3/--c4 on a card, for 2 / 3 / 4 cards a row). Each card carries data-days / data-area /
    data-q and its time chips data-att + the row's data-days, for the filters (committee.js →
    cmGvMeetings, which hides empty regions and re-packs the rows); data-mtg lists its meetings'
    old #mtg-… addresses. Without JavaScript the filters stay hidden and every group shows. -#}
{% macro gvgCard(p, L, h) %}
{%- set attIcon = "video" if p.attendance == "online" else ("users-round" if p.attendance == "in_person" else "monitor-smartphone") -%}
<li id="{{ p.anchor }}" class="cm-gvg card{{ ' is-nearby' if not p.inArea }}" style="--c2: {{ p.span.s2 }}; --c3: {{ p.span.s3 }}; --c4: {{ p.span.s4 }}" data-gvg data-area="{{ 'ours' if p.inArea else 'nearby' }}" data-days="{{ p.days | join(' ') }}" data-q="{{ p.search }}" data-mtg="{{ p.ids | join(' ') }}">
  <div class="cm-gvg-top">
    <p class="cm-gvg-where">{{ p.placeLine }}</p>
    <span class="cm-gvg-today" data-gvm-today hidden>{% icon "sun", "size-3.5" %} {{ "committee.gvm.meets_today" | t(L) }}</span>
  </div>
  <h{{ h }} class="cm-gvg-name">{{ p.name }}</h{{ h }}>
  <p class="cm-gvg-badges">
    {%- for b in p.badges %}
    <span class="{{ 'badge-gv' if b.gv else 'badge-muted' }}">{% if b.gv %}{% icon "grapes", "size-3" %} {% endif %}{{ b.label }}</span>
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- if p.spanish %}<span class="badge-lv">{% icon "languages", "size-3" %} {{ "committee.weekly.lang_es" | t(L) }}</span>{% endif %}
    {%- if p.access %}<span class="badge-muted">{% icon "accessibility", "size-3" %} {{ "committee.gvm.access" | t(L) }}</span>{% endif %}
  </p>

  {#- The body lays itself out by the card's width: stacked, or the week | the place + links side by
      side when a card spans a whole row (committee.css .cm-gvg-body, a container) -#}
  <div class="cm-gvg-body">
  <div class="cm-gvg-inner">
  {#- The week: one row per set of weekdays with the same meetings -#}
  <div class="cm-gvg-sched">
    <ul class="cm-gvg-rows" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'committee.gvm.schedule' | t(L) }}">
      {%- for r in p.rows %}
      <li class="cm-gvg-row" data-days="{{ r.days | join(' ') }}">
        <span class="cm-gvg-day"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ r.label }}</span><span class="sr-only">{{ r.sr }}:</span></span>
        <span class="cm-gvg-times">
          {%- for s in r.slots %}
          <span class="cm-gvg-time" data-slot data-att="{{ s.att }}" data-n="{{ r.n }}">{{ s.time }}{% if s.extras | length %} <span class="cm-gvg-extra">{{ s.extras | join(" · ") }}</span>{% endif %}</span>{% if not loop.last %}<span class="sr-only">, </span>{% endif %}
          {%- endfor %}
        </span>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="cm-gvg-place">
  <ul class="cm-gvm-meta" role="list">
    {% if p.address or p.location or p.approximate %}
    <li>
      {% icon "map-pin", "size-4 shrink-0 text-faint" %}
      <span class="min-w-0">
        {% if p.address and not p.approximate %}<span class="block text-ink">{{ p.address }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% if p.location %}<span class="block"{% if p.textLang != L %} lang="{{ p.textLang }}"{% endif %}>{{ p.location }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% if p.approximate %}<span class="block">{{ "committee.gvm.approx" | t(L) }}</span>{% endif %}
      </span>
    </li>
    {% endif %}
    <li>{% icon attIcon, "size-4 shrink-0 text-faint" %}<span>{{ p.attLabel }}</span></li>
  </ul>
  {#- a group in two lists names both offices -#}
  {% if p.listedBy | length > 1 %}<p class="cm-gvm-src">{{ "committee.gvm.listed_by" | t(L, { names: p.listedBy | join(" · ") }) }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>

  {#- Two equal buttons, then the office's site as a one-line caption: every card's bottom lines up -#}
  <div class="cm-gvg-actions">
    <div class="cm-gvg-btns">
      {% if p.directions %}<a class="btn-secondary btn-sm" href="{{ p.directions }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ 'committee.gvm.directions_aria' | t(L, { name: p.name }) }}">{% icon "navigation", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.gvm.directions" | t(L) }}</a>{% endif %}
      {% if p.url %}<a class="btn-secondary btn-sm" href="{{ p.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ 'committee.gvm.details_aria' | t(L, { site: p.siteHost, name: p.name }) }}">{% icon "external-link", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.gvm.details_btn" | t(L) }}</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if p.url and p.siteHost %}<p class="cm-gvg-host">{{ "committee.gvm.source_host" | t(L, { site: p.siteHost }) }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</li>
{% endmacro %}

{#- "12 groups · 13 meetings" (a region's head; committee.js rewrites it while filtering) -#}
{%- set countTpl = { one: "committee.gvm.count_one" | t(lang), many: "committee.gvm.count" | t(lang) } -%}
{%- set groupTpl = { one: "committee.gvm.groups_one" | t(lang), many: "committee.gvm.groups" | t(lang) } -%}
{% macro gvCount(groups, meetings, gt, ct) -%}
<span data-gvm-count>{{ (gt.one if groups == 1 else gt.many) | replace("{n}", groups) }} · {{ (ct.one if meetings == 1 else ct.many) | replace("{n}", meetings) }}</span>
{%- endmacro %}

{#- One region: its head (icon · name · counts) on the first row, its cards on the second (subgrid) -#}
{% macro gvRegion(g, L, tone) %}
<section class="cm-gvg-region" style="--r2: {{ g.span.s2 }}; --r3: {{ g.span.s3 }}; --r4: {{ g.span.s4 }}; --h1: {{ g.span.h1 }}; --h2: {{ g.span.h2 }}; --h3: {{ g.span.h3 }}; --h4: {{ g.span.h4 }}" data-gvm-group="{{ g.id }}" aria-labelledby="gvm-g-{{ g.id }}">
  <div class="cm-gvg-region-head">
    <span class="cm-gvm-group-icon {{ tone }}" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "map-pin", "size-5" %}</span>
    <div class="min-w-0">
      <h4 id="gvm-g-{{ g.id }}" class="cm-gvg-region-title">{{ g.label }}</h4>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted">{{ gvCount(g.placeCount, g.count, groupTpl, countTpl) }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="cm-gvg-grid" role="list">
    {%- for p in g.places %}{{ gvgCard(p, L, 5) }}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
{% endmacro %}

<section class="section section-band" aria-labelledby="gvm-title"
  x-data="cmGvMeetings()" data-total="{{ gvm.total }}"
  data-count-label="{{ 'committee.gvm.showing' | t(lang, { total: gvm.total }) }}" data-count-label-one="{{ 'committee.gvm.showing_one' | t(lang, { total: gvm.total }) }}"
  data-groups-one="{{ groupTpl.one }}" data-groups-many="{{ groupTpl.many }}" data-meetings-one="{{ countTpl.one }}" data-meetings-many="{{ countTpl.many }}" data-today-label="{{ 'committee.gvm.day_today' | t(lang) }}">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div id="grapevine-meetings">
    {{ ui.sectionHead("committee.gvm.title" | t(lang), "committee.gvm.what" | t(lang), "", "", "grapes",
      { eyebrow: "committee.gvm.eyebrow" | t(lang), id: "gvm-title", lang: lang }) }}
    </div>

    {% if gvm.total %}
    {#- ---------- Filters (JavaScript only: without it every group shows) ---------- -#}
    <div class="cm-gvm-filters card" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'committee.gvm.filters_aria' | t(lang) }}" x-cloak>
      <div class="cm-gvm-field cm-gvm-field--q">
        <label for="gvm-q-{{ lang }}" class="cm-gvm-label">{{ "committee.gvm.f_where" | t(lang) }}</label>
        <div class="relative">
          <span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-3.5 grid place-items-center text-faint" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "search", "size-4" %}</span>
          <input id="gvm-q-{{ lang }}" type="search" class="input pl-10" x-model.debounce.150ms="q" placeholder="{{ 'committee.gvm.f_where_ph' | t(lang) }}" autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="search" spellcheck="false">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cm-gvm-field">
        <label for="gvm-day-{{ lang }}" class="cm-gvm-label">{{ "committee.gvm.f_day" | t(lang) }}</label>
        <div class="relative">
          <select id="gvm-day-{{ lang }}" class="input cm-gvm-select" x-model="day">
            <option value="">{{ "committee.gvm.f_any_day" | t(lang) }}</option>
            {%- for dc in gvm.dayCounts %}
            <option value="{{ dc.day }}" data-name="{{ dc.name }}"{% if not dc.count %} disabled{% endif %}>{{ dc.name }}</option>
            {%- endfor %}
          </select>
          <span class="cm-gvm-chev" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "chevron-down", "size-4" %}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cm-gvm-field">
        <label for="gvm-how-{{ lang }}" class="cm-gvm-label">{{ "committee.gvm.f_how" | t(lang) }}</label>
        <div class="relative">
          <select id="gvm-how-{{ lang }}" class="input cm-gvm-select" x-model="how">
            <option value="">{{ "committee.gvm.f_how_any" | t(lang) }}</option>
            <option value="in_person">{{ "committee.gvm.att_in_person" | t(lang) }}</option>
            <option value="online">{{ "committee.gvm.att_online" | t(lang) }}</option>
          </select>
          <span class="cm-gvm-chev" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "chevron-down", "size-4" %}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% if gvm.nearby %}
      <label class="cm-gvm-toggle">
        <input type="checkbox" class="cm-switch" x-model="nearby">
        <span>{{ "committee.gvm.f_nearby" | t(lang) }} <span class="cm-chip-count" aria-hidden="true">{{ gvm.nearbyPlaces }}</span><span class="sr-only"> ({{ (groupTpl.one if gvm.nearbyPlaces == 1 else groupTpl.many) | replace("{n}", gvm.nearbyPlaces) }})</span></span>
      </label>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {#- What is shown (the filters rewrite it) · the one note that matters before you go -#}
    <div class="cm-gvm-status">
      <div class="flex min-h-11 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink" aria-live="polite" x-text="statusText">{{ "committee.gvm.showing" | t(lang, { n: gvm.total, total: gvm.total }) | replace("{groups}", (groupTpl.one if gvm.places == 1 else groupTpl.many) | replace("{n}", gvm.places)) }}</p>
        <button type="button" class="btn-ghost btn-sm" x-show="filtered" x-cloak @click="reset()">{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.gvm.f_reset" | t(lang) }}</button>
      </div>
      <p class="flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted"><span class="mt-0.5 text-faint">{% icon "clock-3", "size-4" %}</span><span>{{ "committee.gvm.times_note" | t(lang) }}</span></p>
    </div>

    {#- ---------- Our Area (the main list), by office region ---------- -#}
    <div class="cm-gvm-group" data-gvm-group="ours">
      <div class="cm-gvm-group-head">
        <span class="cm-gvm-group-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "map-pinned", "size-5" %}</span>
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <h3 class="cm-gvm-group-title">{{ "committee.gvm.area_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">{{ gvCount(gvm.areaGroup.placeCount, gvm.inArea, groupTpl, countTpl) }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% if gvm.inArea %}
      <div class="cm-gvg-regions" data-gvm-regions>
        {% for g in gvm.areaGroup.regions %}{{ gvRegion(g, lang, "") }}{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% else %}<p class="text-muted">{{ "committee.gvm.area_none" | t(lang) }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>

    {#- ---------- Nearby areas (outside NETA 65): the same region blocks ---------- -#}
    {% if gvm.nearbyGroups | length %}
    <div class="cm-gvm-group cm-gvm-nearby" data-gvm-nearby>
      <div class="cm-gvm-group-head">
        <span class="cm-gvm-group-icon is-vine" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "compass", "size-5" %}</span>
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <h3 class="cm-gvm-group-title">{{ "committee.gvm.nearby_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">{{ "committee.gvm.nearby_sub" | t(lang) }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cm-gvg-regions" data-gvm-regions>
        {% for g in gvm.nearbyGroups %}{{ gvRegion(g, lang, "is-vine") }}{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="empty-state mt-8" x-show="shown === 0" x-cloak>
      <span class="mx-auto mb-3 grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-surface-2 text-faint">{% icon "search", "size-6" %}</span>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ "committee.gvm.none" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm mt-4" @click="reset()">{% icon "rotate-ccw", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.gvm.f_reset" | t(lang) }}</button>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    {#- ---------- No data (never read, or every list failed): where to look instead ---------- -#}
    <div class="empty-state">
      <span class="mx-auto mb-3 grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-surface-2 text-faint">{% icon "map-pin", "size-6" %}</span>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ "committee.gvm.empty_title" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-1 max-w-xl text-sm">{{ "committee.gvm.empty_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
      {% if gvm.offices | length %}
      <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2" role="list">
        {% for o in gvm.offices %}<li><a class="btn-secondary btn-sm" href="{{ o.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "external-link", "size-4" %} {{ o.name }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {#- ---------- Where the list comes from | how a group gets on it: two matching flat panels ---------- -#}
    <div class="mt-10 grid items-start gap-5 sm:mt-12{{ ' lg:grid-cols-2' if gvm.total }}">
      {% if gvm.total %}
      <div class="panel-muted">
        <h3 class="card-h"><span>{% icon "list-checks", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "committee.gvm.src_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        {% if gvm.okSources | length %}
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "committee.gvm.from_lists" | t(lang) }}
          {% for s in gvm.okSources %}<a class="link" href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ s.name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}<span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><span class="sr-only">, </span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if gvm.failed | length %}
        <p class="mt-3 flex gap-2.5 text-sm text-lv-strong"><span class="mt-0.5">{% icon "triangle-alert", "size-4" %}</span><span>{{ "committee.gvm.failed" | t(lang, { names: gvm.failed | join(", ") }) }}</span></p>
        {% endif %}
        {{ ui.freshness(gvm.updated, lang, { note: true, class: "mt-3" }) }}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="panel-muted{{ '' if gvm.total else ' lg:max-w-2xl' }}">
        <h3 class="card-h"><span>{% icon "book-open-text", "size-5" %}</span>{{ "committee.gvm.cta_title" | t(lang) }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "committee.gvm.cta_text" | t(lang) }}</p>
        <a class="btn-secondary btn-sm mt-4" href="{{ site.contact_email | mailto('committee.gvm.cta_subject' | t(lang)) }}">{% icon "mail", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.gvm.cta_btn" | t(lang) }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- ============ Weekly open meetings (the canonical home: /meetings/#weekly-open) ============
    Not our meetings, so they come last: AA Grapevine's Weekly Open (Wednesdays, English) and
    La Viña's Reunión Abierta (Thursdays, Spanish) — db.weekly_open.items, the page language's
    meeting first. Each card: language badge, day + time (Central and Eastern), the next date
    (committee.js rolls it forward; before La Viña's first meeting it says "Starts …"), Zoom ID +
    passcode with copy buttons, Join. Phones: stacked; from 1024px side by side, the two parts of
    each card on shared rows (subgrid) so the Zoom boxes line up. #weekly-open is linked from the
    home page, /listen/, /watch/ and the site search — nowhere else repeats the Zoom details. -#}
{%- set closing = "committee.weekly.closing" | t(lang) -%}
{#- Both meetings in the same Zoom room (the usual case): the ID and passcode are said once, in a
    strip under the two cards, instead of twice -#}
{%- set sharedZoom = (wos | length == 2) and wos[0].zoomId and (wos[0].zoomId == wos[1].zoomId) and (wos[0].passcode == wos[1].passcode) -%}
{% macro zoomFields(zoomId, zoomDigits, passcode, idAria, passAria) %}
<dl class="grid gap-3 @min-[36rem]:grid-cols-2">
  {% if zoomId %}
  <div class="cm-field">
    <dt class="eyebrow">{{ "committee.meeting.id" | t(lang) }}</dt>
    <dd class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap text-ink">{{ zoomId }}</span>
      <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm" data-copy="{{ zoomDigits }}" aria-label="{{ idAria }}">{% icon "copy", "size-4" %} {{ "common.copy" | t(lang) }}</button>
    </dd>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if passcode %}
  <div class="cm-field">
    <dt class="eyebrow">{{ "committee.meeting.passcode" | t(lang) }}</dt>
    <dd class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-2">
      <span class="font-mono text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink">{{ passcode }}</span>
      <button type="button" class="btn-secondary btn-sm" data-copy="{{ passcode }}" aria-label="{{ passAria }}">{% icon "copy", "size-4" %} {{ "common.copy" | t(lang) }}</button>
    </dd>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</dl>
{% endmacro %}
<section class="container-page section pb-0" aria-labelledby="weekly-title">
  <div id="weekly-open">
  {{ ui.sectionHead("committee.weekly.section_title" | t(lang), "committee.weekly.section_text" | t(lang), "", "", "grapes",
    { eyebrow: "committee.weekly.eyebrow" | t(lang), tone: "text-grape", id: "weekly-title", lang: lang }) }}
  </div>
  {% if wos | length %}
  {#- From 1024px side by side; each card's parts sit on rows shared with the other card (subgrid:
      title · text · day and time · links), so the day pills and the buttons line up -#}
  <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-x-6 lg:gap-y-0">
    {% for w in wos %}
    {%- set key = "lv" if w.isLv else "gv" -%}
    <article class="card flex flex-col overflow-hidden lg:row-span-4 lg:grid lg:grid-rows-subgrid lg:gap-0" aria-labelledby="wo-{{ key }}-title">
      <div class="flex flex-col border-b border-line bg-surface-2 p-6 sm:p-7 lg:row-span-3 lg:grid lg:grid-rows-subgrid lg:gap-0 {{ 'bg-[radial-gradient(120%_100%_at_0%_0%,var(--c-lv-soft),transparent_70%)]' if w.isLv else 'bg-[radial-gradient(120%_100%_at_0%_0%,var(--c-grape-soft),transparent_70%)]' }}">
        <div>
          <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
            <span class="{{ 'badge-lv' if w.isLv else 'badge-gv' }}">{% icon "grapes", "size-3" %} {{ "La Viña" if w.isLv else "Grapevine" }}</span>
            <span class="badge-muted">{% icon "languages", "size-3" %} {{ ("committee.weekly.lang_" + w.lang) | t(lang) }}</span>
          </p>
          <h3 id="wo-{{ key }}-title" class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-balance text-ink">{{ w.title or ("committee.weekly.title" | t(lang)) }}</h3>
        </div>
        {#- La Viña: the flyer's own words (config/site.yml); its closing line is the section's sign-off below -#}
        <p class="measure mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ (w.summary | replace(closing, "") | trim) if w.isLv else ("committee.weekly.gv_text" | t(lang)) }}</p>

        <div class="mt-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-1.5">
            <p class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-surface px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink shadow-sm ring-1 ring-line">
              {% icon "calendar-clock", "size-4 " + ("text-lv" if w.isLv else "text-grape") %}
              <span>{{ w.day }}</span>
            </p>
            <p class="px-1 text-sm text-muted">{{ w.timeCentral }}{% if w.hostTime %} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {{ w.hostTime }}{% endif %}</p>
          </div>
          {% if w.next %}
          <p class="mt-4 flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-muted" data-cm-weekly="{{ w.next.iso }}" data-cm-weekly-tz="{{ w.next.tz }}"{% if w.next.at %} data-cm-weekly-at="{{ w.next.at }}"{% endif %}{% if w.starts %} data-cm-weekly-starts="{{ w.starts.iso }}"{% endif %}>
            <span class="mt-0.5 {{ 'text-lv' if w.isLv else 'text-grape' }}">{% icon "arrow-right", "size-4" %}</span>
            <span>
              {%- if w.starts %}
              <span class="font-semibold text-ink" data-cm-weekly-label data-next="{{ 'committee.weekly.next' | t(lang) }}" data-live="{{ 'committee.meeting.live_now' | t(lang) }}">{{ "committee.weekly.starts" | t(lang, { date: w.starts.date }) }}</span>
              <span data-cm-weekly-date>· {{ w.starts.time }}</span>
              {%- else %}
              <span class="font-semibold text-ink" data-cm-weekly-label data-next="{{ 'committee.weekly.next' | t(lang) }}" data-live="{{ 'committee.meeting.live_now' | t(lang) }}">{{ "committee.weekly.next" | t(lang) }}</span>
              <span data-cm-weekly-date>{{ w.next.date }} · {{ w.next.time }}</span>
              {%- endif %}
              <span class="block text-xs" data-cm-weekly-local data-tpl="{{ 'committee.meeting.your_time' | t(lang) }}" hidden></span>
            </span>
          </p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="@container flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-7">
        {% if not sharedZoom %}<div class="mb-5">{{ zoomFields(w.zoomId, w.zoomDigits, w.passcode, ("committee.weekly.copy_id_" + key) | t(lang), ("committee.weekly.copy_passcode_" + key) | t(lang)) }}</div>{% endif %}
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
          {% if w.zoomUrl %}<a class="btn-primary" href="{{ w.zoomUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ ('committee.weekly.join_' + key) | t(lang) }}">{% icon "video", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.meeting.join" | t(lang) }}</a>{% endif %}
          {% if not w.isLv %}<a class="btn-secondary" href="{{ '/listen/?show=wo#episodes' | lurl(lang) }}">{% icon "headphones", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.weekly.listen" | t(lang) }}</a>{% endif %}
          {% if w.detailsUrl %}<a class="btn-ghost" href="{{ w.detailsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "external-link", "size-4" %} {{ ("committee.weekly.details_" + key) | t(lang) }}</a>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <p class="mt-auto pt-4 text-xs text-faint">{{ ("committee.weekly.source_" + key) | t(lang) }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if sharedZoom %}
  {#- The shared Zoom room: one strip under both cards -#}
  <div class="card card-pad @container mt-5 lg:mt-6">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-4 @min-[48rem]:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.6fr)] @min-[48rem]:gap-8">
      <p class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-grape-soft text-grape" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "video", "size-5" %}</span>
        <span class="min-w-0">
          <span class="block font-semibold text-ink">{{ "committee.weekly.same_zoom" | t(lang) }}</span>
          <span class="mt-0.5 block text-sm text-muted">{{ "committee.weekly.same_zoom_sub" | t(lang) }}</span>
        </span>
      </p>
      {{ zoomFields(wos[0].zoomId, wos[0].zoomDigits, wos[0].passcode, "committee.meeting.copy_id" | t(lang), "committee.meeting.copy_passcode" | t(lang)) }}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  <p class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5 text-center font-display text-lg font-semibold text-balance text-ink sm:flex-row sm:gap-2.5 sm:text-xl">
    <span class="shrink-0 text-lv">{% icon "heart-handshake", "size-5" %}</span>
    <span>{{ closing }}</span>
  </p>
  {% else %}
  <div class="card card-pad flex flex-col items-start gap-3">
    <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ "committee.weekly.text" | t(lang) }}</p>
    <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{ site.links.weekly_open }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{% icon "external-link", "size-4" %} {{ "committee.weekly.details_gv" | t(lang) }}</a>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
